  "text": "proprium.sacratissimi-cordis-iesu-offertorium",
  "about": "The Offertory of the feast of the Most Sacred Heart of Jesus. Christ's Heart looks for compassion amid reproach and sorrow but finds no comforter.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "My Heart expected reproach and misery; and I looked for one that would grieve together with Me, but there was none; I sought one to comfort Me, and I found none." }
